    kind: work_item  # e469
    title: "scala parameterless calls (Runtime.getRuntime.availableProcessors) and kotlin synthetic getters (proc.inputStream) emit no calls edge, so a JDK no-argument read is invisible however its receiver is typed"  # e469
    status: todo_hard  # e469
    priority: 2  # e469
    parent:  # e469
    tags:  # e469
    - scala  # e469
    - kotlin  # e469
